							"text": "with ship as\r\n(\r\n\tselect distinct OrderNumber,ShiptoCountryCode, ShiptoCountry, ShiptoState, ShiptoZipCode from edw.Fact_Bookings\r\n\twhere OrderNumber in (select distinct OrderNum from temp_Sales)\r\n)\r\nupdate t set\r\n\tt.Country = s.ShiptoCountry,\r\n\tt.CountryCode = s.ShiptoCountryCode,\r\n\tt.State = s.ShiptoState,\r\n\tt.ZipCode = s.ShiptoZipCode\r\nfrom temp_Sales t\r\ninner join ship s on  t.OrderNum = s.OrderNumber;"
